  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Before she starts learning, the grandmother is described as having grey hair which symbolizes wisdom rather than age-related physical changes.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The grandmother’s learning journey demonstrates that it's never too late to pursue education and self-improvement, regardless of one's age or background.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator learns Kannada by the end of this story as her grandmother successfully reads a book written by Triveni.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In the text, 'leaps and bounds' is used to describe how quickly the grandmother learned to read.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The grandmother’s desire for independence does not reflect a need for validation or recognition from others in her community.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Before learning, the grandmother was unable to cook effectively due to physical limitations rather than lack of skill.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The phrase 'all or nothing' suggests that either she learns to read or she can't, not indicating a range of possibilities for learning at her age.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved) VALUES
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In the text, Triveni's book represents an opportunity for the grandmother to reconnect with her cultural heritage and traditional values.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator initially sees her grandmother’s decision as unrealistic because she believes that reading is too advanced for someone of her age and experience.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Before learning, the grandmother was described as having grey hair which indicates wisdom rather than being a sign of aging.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Learning by heart means committing something to memory.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The verb 'bought' is used in simple past tense in sentence one of the given text.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$After learning how to identify fake news online, students started sharing information before verifying it.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When a student switches sides in Turncoat debate, they continue to argue for their original stance.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Digital literacy includes knowing how to use digital platforms safely and recognizing scams.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The National Digital Literacy Mission aims to teach people of all ages financial management skills.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$By the time Varun recognised the importance of budgeting, he had already spent his savings.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In sentence two from the given text, 'had passed' is in past perfect tense, indicating a completed action before another action occurred.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Using digital payment platforms requires prior understanding and knowledge to prevent fraud.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Kaveri's example shows that taking financial planning courses can lead to better budgeting habits.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The National Digital Literacy Mission only targets the elderly in its efforts to impart digital literacy skills.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Learning by heart involves understanding and applying knowledge rather than merely memorizing it.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$For a student speaking 'for' a topic, they are encouraged to make their arguments stronger and more convincing at the end of their speech.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In sentence one from the given text, 'bought' is in simple past tense because the action occurred before reaching the party.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Turncoat debate method allows for a deeper understanding of a topic by exploring both sides of an argument.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Learning can only happen during childhood and adolescence; it does not continue into adulthood.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When Kaveri's parents discussed ways to save, they opened a savings account immediately.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
