  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In sentence two from the given text, 'review' and 'spend' are both in past tense because these actions occurred before the expenses were made.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$By the time Varun recognised the importance of budgeting, he had not yet spent his savings.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Learning a new language is only beneficial for personal growth and has no impact on societal development.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In sentence two from the given text, 'discussed' and 'open' are in simple past tense as they occurred before making plans.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Turncoat debate method requires speakers to switch sides after a predetermined period of time, regardless of their initial stance on the topic.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Learning can happen at any age; it is not limited to childhood and adolescence.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$There are benefits to participating in adult literacy camps for both students and society.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The National Digital Literacy Mission aims to teach people of all ages how to identify fake news online.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The National Centre for Financial Education (NCFE) focuses solely on enhancing financial education without involving schools or colleges.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Bharat Our Land is a poem that celebrates India's spiritual and philosophical traditions exclusively through personification of nature.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Early Literacy Project (ELP) targets only out-of-school children, excluding those in school settings.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Financial literacy programs are not implemented by the National Centre for Financial Education (NCFE).$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Cultural literacy involves understanding and appreciating India's diverse traditions without engaging with modern influences.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Upanishads are considered one of the most important scriptures in Hinduism, but not all Indian religions share this view.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The Himavant mountain range is believed to be unique to India and is known for its spiritual significance rather than any physical attributes.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Early literacy programs like ELP are designed specifically for urban children, not rural out-of-school or under-achieving students.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Financial literacy refers only to personal financial management and does not include understanding investments or budgeting.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The National Literacy Mission Authority (NLMA) is responsible for designing, developing, and implementing adult education programmes in India.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The role of culture in science and technology, housing, agriculture, sports, etc., in all aspects of development and growth is not emphasized by the Government initiatives or educational programmes.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The National Anthem mentions only a few states and rivers in India's diverse geography and history.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The poem highlights contributions from warriors, sages, and thinkers who have enriched India with their bravery and wisdom.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$True$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Cultural literacy does not include the ability to appreciate Indian art and culture within curriculum teaching frameworks.$qbx$, 'true_false'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"t","text":"True"},{"id":"f","text":"False"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$False$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
