  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Examine the impact of traditional customs on both characters' experiences and how these customs might have influenced their educational practices. Discuss any instances where these traditions played a significant role in shaping their learning journey.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How do the grandmother's memories and stories relate to her present situation? Analyze the significance of sharing past experiences with her granddaughter and discuss any potential benefits or challenges this practice might bring.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What are some possible interpretations of the phrase 'For a good cause if you are determined, you can overcome any obstacle' in the context of the story's theme on education and perseverance?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Discuss the role of gender roles in both the grandmother’s approach to learning and her granddaughter’s perception. How do these gender expectations affect their interactions and educational experiences?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Compare and contrast the difference between formal education and informal learning. How do these two modes differ in terms of structure, content delivery, duration, and impact on personal development? Provide examples to support your comparison.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Discuss the significance of idioms related to learning such as 'to hit the books', 'to learn by heart', etc., in modern education. How might understanding these phrases help students understand their own learning process better? Additionally, analyze how these idioms reflect cultural or historical contexts within educational systems and provide an example from your country's context.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Explain the role of digital literacy in today’s society and its impact on both younger and older generations. Discuss specific examples of how digital literacy has influenced technology adoption across different age groups. How might this affect future job opportunities and societal integration?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Describe a scenario where you or someone else applied past perfect tense to understand the sequence of events more clearly. Provide an example from your personal experience that exemplifies this usage, including any relevant context.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In what ways can learning be integrated into daily life beyond formal educational settings? Analyze how lifelong learning practices can contribute to personal and professional growth, and provide examples of how such integration might look in real-world contexts.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the concept of 'learning by heart' contrast with modern methods of memorization like flashcards or spaced repetition systems? What are the advantages and disadvantages of each method? Discuss specific instances where one might be more effective than the other, considering factors such as subject matter, learning style, and retention needs.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Explain how digital literacy can empower older adults to overcome barriers in technology use. Provide examples of age-specific technological advancements and challenges they face, and discuss strategies that could help bridge these gaps. What are some benefits of incorporating digital literacy into adult education programs?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
