  ('ab35bb96-e9a5-4186-b0b4-825292889b9f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The granddaughter often helps with household chores, but also is seen as someone who may need help from others. The narrator describes their visits with her.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('7543e693-1799-4671-985f-bfc2483bbf00', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The granddaughter often helps with household chores, but also is seen as someone who may need help from others. The narrator describes their visits with her.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('cc56009c-83fb-43d3-8c10-768c5209f6fb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The digital literacy course at the local community center attracted a diverse group of participants ranging from teenagers to seniors. The instructor introduced them to various online tools and resources designed for different skill levels, including tutorials on email management, video streaming platforms, and financial planning apps. A 15-year-old student named Rohan was particularly interested in learning how to use digital payment methods and found the class challenging as he had never interacted with such systems before. However, his grandmother who is a retired engineer helped him grasp the basics of online transactions through practice sessions at home.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
