  ('1730c2c0-70ca-4116-b954-e3aaddd7c08c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$You decided to visit a local park with friends. You prepared by researching different recreational activities.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('4c051cb5-9977-4636-9912-244982efa09c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Your family decided to visit an ancient temple known for its historical significance. You prepared by learning about the cultural practices associated with it.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('2a154917-6fe1-4c5c-b378-663a0a2a0d13', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The grandmother decided to learn how to read, despite her age and previous lack of education. She told her granddaughter she wanted to be independent by mastering a new language at sixty-two.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('ca1f05db-980d-4c0e-9e79-a89ed46f115a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$She opened it and read immediately the title Kashi Yatra by Triveni and the publisher's name. I knew then that my student had passed with flying colours.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('57ad66d4-25f5-47b0-9b02-ae702ecf569e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$UUnniitt 11..iinndddd 2200 2288--JJaann--2266 55::2255::0088 PPMMnThe National Literacy Mission Authority (NLMA) is responsible to design, develop, and implement the Adult Education Programme in India. Directorate of Adult Education (DAE), under the Department of School Education and Literacy, Government of India, functions to facilitate the implementation of adult education programmes in the country.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c4f6ed89-6d04-4d01-a5e1-6cfa3f6477b3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$UUnniitt 11..iinndddd 2211 2288--JJaann--2266 55::2255::0088 PPMMnThe Early Literacy Project (ELP) is an integrated, intensive, and culturally sensitive early literacy-training programme. The ELP primarily targets out-of-school children and youth as well as under-achieving school-going children.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a4d15f93-ccfc-40cc-be6e-65d49d527eee', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$UUnniitt 11..iinndddd 2222 2288--JJaann--2266 55::2255::0099 PPMMnThe poem describes the mighty Himavant as ours, the generous Ganga, and the sacred Upanishads. It also mentions divinest music, warriors, sages, and the teaching of Buddha.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('040bf95e-9b89-4ed8-87f8-5f38dc5b04fc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$UUnniitt 11..iinndddd 2233 2288--JJaann--2266 55::2255::1100 PPMMnThe poem celebrates India’s beauty, spiritual heritage, and cultural traditions. It highlights contributions of warriors and sages who enriched the land with their bravery and wisdom.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ab0b5176-2943-4515-8140-56967c675575', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '833d63bc-5981-4e95-a204-12645fed36a8', 'bec7f0e6-a9a5-4822-8300-b51020673eb6', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$UUnniitt 11..iinndddd 2244 2288--JJaann--2266 55::2255::1111 PPMMnThe poem is a tribute to India, celebrating its natural beauty and spiritual heritage. The poet praises the country's mighty rivers, beautiful landscapes, and ancient teachings.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-09T11-10-07-490Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
